WEBVTT

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:08.102
Good morning, I'm Anders Fjell, and this is Nordic Crypto.

00:00:08.706 --> 00:00:12.293
This week: Binance says most stolen assets have been
replaced.

00:00:12.293 --> 00:00:15.008
The FBI blames North Korea for the hack.

00:00:15.008 --> 00:00:17.345
And Sweden looks at tokenised money.

00:00:19.542 --> 00:00:23.969
Binance says about ninety percent of the stolen assets have
been replaced with its own funds.

00:00:23.969 --> 00:00:26.111
The stolen coins are not back.

00:00:26.111 --> 00:00:27.801
NRK reported it.

00:00:28.418 --> 00:00:33.638
The FBI says North Korea was behind the theft of more than
six billion dollars from Binance, under the name

00:00:33.638 --> 00:00:34.321
TraderTraitor.

00:00:34.321 --> 00:00:37.036
E24 reported the FBI's statement.

00:00:37.654 --> 00:00:42.993
Norway's justice minister told Aftenposten the theft shows
cybersecurity can be a public-security matter.

00:00:42.993 --> 00:00:46.149
Kaupr reported that, and Swedish experts' concern.

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:51.788
Binance confirms a loss of about six point three billion
dollars, with about three billion frozen.

00:00:51.788 --> 00:00:54.421
Investornytt called it a possible record hack.

00:00:55.022 --> 00:01:00.936
In Kautokeino the mayor says a data-centre plot was decided
politically, and Arctic Core is still involved, Ságat

00:01:00.936 --> 00:01:01.355
reports.

00:01:01.954 --> 00:01:07.672
Vialet says it will use tokenised money-market funds through
Axiology, supervised by the Bank of Lithuania.

00:01:07.672 --> 00:01:09.271
Kaupr reported it.

00:01:09.870 --> 00:01:15.138
ESMA wants evidence on tokenised collateral at central
counterparties, until the fifteenth of January.

00:01:15.138 --> 00:01:17.484
Finanstilsynet reported the call.

00:01:18.098 --> 00:01:22.464
Latvia's economy minister aims to have tokenisation rules in
early 2027.

00:01:22.464 --> 00:01:24.964
That is a goal, not adopted policy.

00:01:24.964 --> 00:01:26.562
Kaupr reported it.

00:01:27.166 --> 00:01:31.214
DTCC plans a tokenisation service for twenty-five
securities.

00:01:31.214 --> 00:01:33.100
Kaupr reported the plan.

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:35.292
It is not confirmed as live.

00:01:37.498 --> 00:01:43.067
Coinbase reported third-quarter net income of about seven
hundred and nineteen million dollars, mostly from crypto

00:01:43.067 --> 00:01:43.360
gains.

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:45.348
Hurbra reported the figures.

00:01:45.966 --> 00:01:51.428
Galaxy Digital reported third-quarter net income of three
hundred and twenty-three million dollars, after a loss.

00:01:51.428 --> 00:01:53.672
Kryptovalutaguiden reported it.

00:01:54.290 --> 00:01:59.681
Sweden's Finansinspektionen is inviting a reference group
for guidance on tokenised money, including tokenised

00:01:59.681 --> 00:02:01.054
deposits and e-money tokens.

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:05.825
Kryptos has launched a ChatGPT plugin for portfolio and tax
questions.

00:02:05.825 --> 00:02:08.243
It cannot trade, Kryptos says.

00:02:08.243 --> 00:02:10.149
Kaupr reported the launch.

00:02:10.746 --> 00:02:16.085
Bitcoin Suisse Europe plans a Nordic launch in early
November under its MiCA licence, Kaupr reports.

00:02:16.694 --> 00:02:21.080
GreenMerc says outsiders reached customer data at Finnish
subsidiary NorthCrypto.

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:24.042
Crypto keys were not affected, the company says.

00:02:24.042 --> 00:02:25.640
Kaupr reported it.

00:02:26.242 --> 00:02:30.956
Zcash co-founder Sean Bowe has drafted a plan to end
automatic funding for community grants.

00:02:30.956 --> 00:02:32.585
It is a draft only.

00:02:32.585 --> 00:02:35.229
Kryptovalutaguiden reported the dispute.

00:02:35.838 --> 00:02:39.692
Goobit is presenting Futureproof, a planned bitcoin and gold
product.

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:42.970
Its return figures are its own, and this is not advice.

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:44.569
Kaupr reported it.

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:52.150
Coop Bank in Denmark lets customers connect an assistant to
investment accounts, read only, the bank says.

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:54.107
The accounts are not crypto.

00:02:54.107 --> 00:02:58.011
Kaupr reports that Bitpanda is opening portfolios to
assistants too.

00:02:58.622 --> 00:03:00.806
That's all for issue number five.

00:03:00.806 --> 00:03:03.511
Every story is at nordiccrypto.no.

00:03:03.511 --> 00:03:05.939
Nothing here is investment advice.

00:03:07.718 --> 00:03:09.246
I'm Anders Fjell.

00:03:09.246 --> 00:03:10.834
See you next week.

